"run_odessa_catacombs_1792970549": [
"Beneath Odesa,",
"a major seaport",
"city located in Ukraine",
"on the northwestern",
"shore of the Black Sea,",
"lies an extensive",
"and complicated",
"labyrinth",
"of subterranean tunnels.",
"During World War",
"Two, enemy aircraft",
"targeted Odesa",
"with aerial bombing",
"raids, making",
"the catacombs",
"a natural underground",
"shelter for civilians",
"escaping aerial bombing.",
"By one estimate,",
"the 1941",
"Siege of Odesa",
"began on August",
"5 and lasted",
"for 73 days",
"before the city",
"fell to Axis occupation.",
"Following the enemy",
"siege of the city,",
"Soviet resistance",
"partisans used",
"the subterranean",
"tunnels as an active",
"hiding place",
"and continued active",
"combat operations.",
"Partisan warfare",
"endured deep",
"beneath Odesa."
],
